---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import news from '../data/news.json';
const date = (s:string)=>new Date(s+'T12:00:00').toLocaleDateString('en-US',{month:'long',day:'numeric',year:'numeric'});
---
<Layout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy"><div class="hero-copy-inner"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-cross">✦</span> Fort Myers, Florida</p><h1>Ancient faith.<br/><em>Living</em><br/>community.</h1><p class="hero-description">Discover the beauty of Orthodox Christianity.<br class="desktop"/> Find a church family on Florida’s Gulf Coast.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/visit/">Come worship with us <Icon name="arrow"/></a><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Meet St. Peter <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></div><div class="hero-footnote"><span class="line"></span> A parish of the Antiochian Orthodox Christian Archdiocese</div></div></div>
    <div class="hero-image"><img src="/assets/church.webp" width="1600" height="1067" alt="Iconography, warm light, and worshippers in an Orthodox church" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="photo-note"><span>“Come and see.”</span><small>JOHN 1:46</small></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="service-strip" aria-label="Worship and location"><div class="wrap service-grid"><div class="service-item"><Icon name="clock" size={28}/><div><p class="eyebrow">Worship with us</p><strong>Sunday Divine Liturgy <span>9:30 am</span></strong></div></div><a class="service-item" href={site.directions} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><Icon name="pin" size={28}/><div><p class="eyebrow">Find your way here</p><strong>7470 Hickory Drive <span>Fort Myers, FL</span></strong></div><Icon name="northeast" size={20}/></a><a class="strip-calendar" href="/calendar/">View our calendar <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div></section>
  <section class="section welcome wrap"><div class="welcome-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Welcome to St. Peter</p><h2>A timeless faith.<br/>A place to <em>belong.</em></h2></div><div class="welcome-copy"><p class="large-copy">We are a community of Orthodox Christians seeking to know Christ and to make His love visible in our everyday lives.</p><p>From our beginnings in a small hotel room to our home in Fort Myers, we have grown together through prayer, worship, and fellowship. Whether you’ve lived here for years or are just passing through, our doors are open to you.</p><a class="text-link" href="/our-story/">Get to know our parish <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div></section>
  <section class="wrap pathways"><a href="/visit/" class="pathway"><span class="card-number">01 / A warm welcome</span><Icon name="pin" size={30}/><h3>Your first visit</h3><p>What to expect, where to find us, and a little help feeling at home.</p><span class="text-link">Plan your visit <Icon name="arrow" size={19}/></span></a><a href="/orthodoxy/" class="pathway"><span class="card-number">02 / An ancient way of life</span><Icon name="cross" size={30}/><h3>Explore Orthodoxy</h3><p>A faith rooted in the Apostles, lived in worship, prayer, and community.</p><span class="text-link">Start exploring <Icon name="arrow" size={19}/></span></a><a href="/homilies/" class="pathway"><span class="card-number">03 / Food for the soul</span><Icon name="book" size={30}/><h3>Listen & grow</h3><p>Homilies, prayers, and resources to accompany your life in Christ.</p><span class="text-link">Find inspiration <Icon name="arrow" size={19}/></span></a></section>
  <section class="section parish-feature wrap"><div class="feature-image"><img src="/assets/interior.webp" width="768" height="887" alt="Candlelit chandelier surrounded by Orthodox iconography" loading="lazy"/><div class="image-caption">Beauty that points us toward God.</div></div><div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Faith is a way of life</p><h2>Rooted in Christ.<br/><em>Growing together.</em></h2><p>Orthodox Christianity is a living tradition of worship, handed down through the centuries. It invites us to encounter God with our whole lives.</p><p>At St. Peter, that journey is shared. We pray together, learn together, and gather in fellowship. There is room to ask questions, to grow, and to begin.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="/orthodoxy/">Discover the Orthodox faith <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div></section>
  <section class="news-section"><div class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Life in our parish</p><h2>News & <em>notes.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/news/">All parish news <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div><div class="news-grid">{news.slice(0,3).map((post,i)=><article class="news-card"><span class="news-category">PARISH NEWS <span>0{i+1}</span></span><time datetime={post.date}>{date(post.date)}</time><h3><a href={`/news/${post.slug}/`}>{post.title}</a></h3><p>{post.excerpt.slice(0,140)}…</p><a class="text-link" href={`/news/${post.slug}/`}>Read the newsletter <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></article>)}</div></div></section>
</Layout>
